/target

# The ROOT Cargo.lock IS committed (see the 2026-08-31 build: commit) so a clone
# builds what was tested. This one is deliberately not: iris-ipc-pipe-bridge is
# a STANDALONE crate, not a workspace member, so `cargo build --workspace` never
# touches it and no gate here has ever resolved or built its lock. Committing a
# lock nothing verifies would publish a pin no one has stood behind.
/crates/iris-ipc-pipe-bridge/Cargo.lock
*.log
*.tmp
.vscode/
backup/
dist/
installer/

# headless run artifacts
iris-ui-headless*
harness-output/
